+/// One batch of 32 rows of the high-accuracy scan. Widening adds keep each
+/// `u16` lane to two table bytes per code column, so columns are summed in
+/// chunks of [`SAFE_U16_CODE_LEN`] (`2 * 128 * 255 < 2^16`) and widened into
+/// `u32`. Lane `l` of the bytes-0..8 accumulator holds row `PERM0[l]` and of
+/// the bytes-8..16 one row `PERM0[8 + l]`, so one `uzp` per chunk restores
+/// natural row order.
+#[cfg(target_arch = "aarch64")]
